                                    "text": "#Is something the matter, {NICKNAME}? If you're looking to have your fortune told, I'm afraid this isn't a good time."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "746910204",
                                    "speaker": "Barbeloth",
                                    "text": "As I said before, this Dodoco remains here before you, but there are a great many things that still demand my attention."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "746910205",
                                    "speaker": "Barbeloth",
                                    "text": "If there's nothing else, I've got research to continue doing."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "746910206",
                                    "speaker": "Barbeloth",
                                    "text": "But please rest assured that a reminder will be sent to me when the person involved in the oracle arrive, and I will make my way over in time."
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "746910207",
                            "text": "Goodbye.",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "746910208",
                                    "speaker": "Barbeloth",
                                    "text": "#...Haha. See you. Have a pleasant day, {NICKNAME}."
                                }
                            ]
